{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this single-player 2D horror adventure, you are a Class-D death row inmate within the SCP Foundation. A power outage has occurred, unleashing SCPs throughout the facility... Escape the perilous compound filled with monstrous entities and bizarre phenomena, uncover the hidden truth behind the blackout, and make the best possible choices for your survival!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Light Containment Zone</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067440/extras/acb2f7b2270956cb45dad50eed906c4e.avif?t=1760548757\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the deepest part of the facility. It houses SCPs under low-level containment, making it a relatively safe area. But don\u2019t let your guard down... dangerous SCPs still lurk within the facility.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Heavy Containment Zone</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067440/extras/4355f0b2f575cdc7626504d11dd590ab.avif?t=1760548757\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the facility's central plaza. To access any area within the compound, you must pass through here. It contains high-level containment zones for SCPs(Keter SCPs). The Heavy Containment Zone is divided into Sector 01 and Sector 02, where the most dangerous entities are held</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Entrance Zone</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067440/extras/3617d77a95befe2695e1834041d29215.avif?t=1760548757\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the entrance to the facility. No SCPs are contained here, and it features the main gate(Gate A) and the rear gate(Gate B). It was originally operated solely for administrative work by staff. But now... it's a place drenched in blood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the horror game SCP \u2013 Containment Breach by Undertow Games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4067440?t=1760548757","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4067440?t=1760548757","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067440/9c748c9a857bbfeace38cde0dd1e9954b12fd17a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760548757","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067440/9c748c9a857bbfeace38cde0dd1e9954b12fd17a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760548757","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this single-player 2D horror adventure, you are a Class-D death row inmate within the SCP Foundation. A power outage has occurred, unleashing SCPs throughout the facility... Escape the perilous compound filled with monstrous entities and bizarre phenomena, uncover the hidden truth behind the blackout, and make the best possible choices for your survival!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Light Containment Zone</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067440/extras/acb2f7b2270956cb45dad50eed906c4e.avif?t=1760548757\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the deepest part of the facility. It houses SCPs under low-level containment, making it a relatively safe area. But don\u2019t let your guard down... dangerous SCPs still lurk within the facility.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Heavy Containment Zone</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067440/extras/4355f0b2f575cdc7626504d11dd590ab.avif?t=1760548757\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the facility's central plaza. To access any area within the compound, you must pass through here. It contains high-level containment zones for SCPs(Keter SCPs). The Heavy Containment Zone is divided into Sector 01 and Sector 02, where the most dangerous entities are held</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Entrance Zone</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067440/extras/3617d77a95befe2695e1834041d29215.avif?t=1760548757\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the entrance to the facility. No SCPs are contained here, and it features the main gate(Gate A) and the rear gate(Gate B). It was originally operated solely for administrative work by staff. But now... it's a place drenched in blood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the horror game SCP \u2013 Containment Breach by Undertow Games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["ReKiwi Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.